disgrace (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sampler root notes (XRNS BaseNote import, per-sample editor);
    Renoise/MIDI octave alignment for labels, notation, LilyPond
    export and live entry; default -O3, LTO/native options, make
    production target.

